  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Plan one day for a mixed diesel/battery truck fleet: which truck runs which trip, when it charges, when it sells energy back to the grid (V2G), and which drivers it needs. It can also size a fleet over a range of days or sweep cost scenarios, years and V2G/external-charging settings. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
